WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.610
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:39.730
What do you think?

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.210
It's lovely.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:44.020
It's very nice.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.490
Do you like it, Little Squirrel?

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:47.360
I do!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:49.850
Huh?

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:54.250
Have you forgotten? This is the 
dress you will wear to the party.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:55.750
Party?

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:58.250
Where I will formally present you.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:01.500
Eh? This is for me, then?

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:03.760
Yes.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:10.830
You will look like a princess 
from a fairy tale, Mei-san.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:19.150
Syunso!

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:20.440
Yes?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.920
What do you think?

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:23.900
Well...

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:33.640
It's nice.

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:39.380
It truly is, isn't it?

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:43.920
I was especially particular 
about this part of the design.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:48.160
Ah, yes. It's very nice.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.310
I knew you'd get it, Syunso.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.850
Ready, Fumi-san?

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.440
Yes!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.700
Measuring, measuring, measuring!

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.440
Measuring, measuring, measuring!

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.290
You help measure, too, Syunso.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:06.200
A-All right.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.200
Measuring, measuring, measuring!

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.330
Measuring, measuring, measuring!

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:26.130
Umm... Can you actually 
measure her like this?

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:25.830
Measuring, measuring, measuring!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.540
Measur—

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.750
Very perceptive, Syunso.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.000
Leave this to us.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.230
Please come this way, Miss.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.170
Let's leave these things
 to the professional tailor.

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:44.190
Now, Mei.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.730
Uh, yes?

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.990
These are the final touches,
 my little squirrel.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.010
No... My fiancée.

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:57.510
O-Okay.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.780
<b>Chat Noir Won't Look Back</b>

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.230
Oh, dear...

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.440
What is it, Fumi-san?

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.800
Well, I was planning to 
shave the bonito flakes,

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.060
but this...

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:39.690
Huh? It's full of brushes.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:43.800
This is Syunso-san's brush case.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.900
The box looks somewhat similar
to the bonito shaver,

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.560
so he must have grabbed that 
one on his way out by mistake.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.760
Huh? On his way out to where?

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.080
School.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.050
School?

00:04:55.050 --> 00:05:00.560
Oh, that's right. Ougai-san did mention 
that Syunso-san is an art student.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.080
Syunso-san must be missing this.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.960
You're probably right. 
I'll take it to him.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.200
Where is his school?

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.080
It's the Tokyo School of Fine Arts in Ueno.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.070
Got it. I'll get going.

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:18.800
Mei-san, what about lunch?

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.440
I'll eat a bunch when I get back!

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:23.830
Okay!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:30.350
<b>Tokyo School 
of Fine Arts</b>

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:34.100
<b>Self-Study          Draw the Air            Okakura Tenshin</b>

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:36.670
Huh? What the heck?

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:40.850
What's "draw the air" supposed 
to mean, Okakura-sensei?

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.650
Hey, Syunso!

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.260
Hey!

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:48.060
I'm talking you, Syunso!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.870
What's that?

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.380
What're you bringing 
bonito to school for?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.050
T-Taikan!

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.870
You know this an art school, right?

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.810
Not a cooking school.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:03.000
You're being too loud.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.120
What's going on?

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:06.020
Syunso brought katsuobushi to school.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.010
Is this a new technique? 
That's so you, Syunso.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:13.230
Come on, Syunso. Don't go getting all mopey.

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.570
I'll let you borrow my stuff, so cheer up.

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:19.530
First things first, what does this even...

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.260
Excuse me...

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:26.020
Sorry to bother you,
 but I'm looking for someone...

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.520
It's you!

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.730
Oh, Syunso-san!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.530
Syunso-san?!

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:38.280
I'm so glad I found you, Syunso-san!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.300
H-Hey...

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:44.310
I-It's a girl! A girl, a girl, a girl!

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:46.680
Syunso's girlfriend!

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:47.550
Wha?!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.790
Syunso, you jerk!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.950
Take that, and that!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.540
Inexcusable!

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:51.540
I'm so jealous!

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:54.980
Wait! Syunso!

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.550
Wait, hey!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.860
Why did you come here?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.060
Oh, I came to bring you this.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:16.650
Do you not actually need it?

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:19.570
Should I not have...?

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.860
No, I need it.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.540
They're my painting tools, after all.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:30.830
I'm glad.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.680
Thanks.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.010
Sure.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:45.010
Sorry about that. 
My classmates were making a fuss.

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:53.690
I'm sorry I made them mistake 
me for your girlfriend.

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.700
It's fine.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:57.640
Huh?

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:03.090
I don't mind.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.830
Oh, okay. Huh?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.120
Syunso!

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.550
Taikan.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:15.470
You're holding out on me, Syunso.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:20.470
I can't believe a blockhead like 
you has such a cute girlfriend.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.710
You'd better introduce me.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.220
It's not like that, though.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:26.600
I'm Yokoyama Taikan.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.730
Syunso's best friend.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:33.570
Nice to meet you. I'm Ayazuki Mei.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:37.280
Mei, huh? Even your name is cute.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.540
Well done, Syunso! You jerk!

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.750
Stop it.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:46.670
Y-You're mistaken. I'm not 
Syunso-san's girlfriend!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.390
Huh? Is that true?

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.120
Yeah...

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:53.680
That means I can be a candidate.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:56.380
Hey!

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.740
Just kidding.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:02.400
You brought Syunso the stuff he forgot, 
didn't you? Thanks for that.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.840
Come on, Syunso. You thank her, too.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.370
K-Knock it off all ready.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.760
Feeling better now?

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:14.650
I get worried when you get 
all bent out of shape.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.350
The exhibition is coming up.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:21.340
If you can't keep painting, 
all our ambition will be ruined.

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:22.400
Our ambition?

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.390
We talked about it long into 
the morning just recently.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:30.920
We're going to revolutionize the art 
world at the next exhibition, aren't we?

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:35.490
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.980
How's your progress?

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.690
I'm just putting the finishing 
touches on things.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.930
What about your black cat painting?

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.560
<i>The black cat?</i>

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.840
It'll be ready in time for 
the exhibition, right?

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:57.570
Syunso?

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:06.790
I might not make it.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.200
Hey, what's that supposed to mean?

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.390
I can't paint.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.350
Huh? What're you talking about?

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.040
What's that?

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.030
Isn't that a katsuobushi shaver?

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.170
You can't mean...

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:48.210
Hey, Syunso, weren't you 
supposed to go to the doctor?!

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:53.090
You didn't go?!

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:01.050
D-Dumbass!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.750
What the hell are you thinking?!

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.390
You're really not going to 
be able to see at this rate!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.230
Why?

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:11.250
It might get better if you 
have the surgery, right?

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.160
Surgery?

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:14.780
Syunso.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:19.650
Say something, Syunso.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.510
Are you giving up?

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.920
Are you really okay with that?

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:29.750
If you're giving up, 
then I'll just do it myself!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:34.540
Hishida Syunso won't be the one
to revolutionize the art world.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.540
Yokoyama Taikan will.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.690
I will make the world notice me!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.720
That's what'll happen if you 
don't go to the doctor!

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.190
Is that what you really want, Syunso?!

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.960
Fine! Do whatever you want!

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:15.180
Please, go to the doctor!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.430
Umm...

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:40.950
I didn't know about your eyes.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.140
Is it that bad?

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.160
If having the surgery means 
you can get better, I—

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.720
There's no guarantee

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.150
I'll get better if I have the surgery.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:07.210
If it fails, I will go blind.

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:12.330
I don't have the black cat 
to show at the exhibition.

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:16.520
And I can't keep my promise with Taikan 
to revolutionize the art world.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:20.240
It's all over now.

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:25.190
I will search for the black cat 
all day, every day, starting today.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:27.990
So please don't say it's all over!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.460
Go to the hospital...

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.190
Syunso-san!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:02.450
It's all over now.

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:06.040
You can't just give up!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:14.110
Please just leave me alone.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:44.350
<i>All I see when I close my eyes is darkness.</i>

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:53.250
<i>This calms me more 
than looking at blurred scenery.</i>

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:56.710
<i>I don't want colors, shapes,</i>

00:14:56.710 --> 00:15:00.420
<i>or anything anymore.</i>

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:11.300
<i>Why do you look at me like that?</i>

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:19.290
<i>I can't paint anymore.</i>

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.640
Syunso-san!

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.340
Syunso-san!

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:31.400
<i>You always shine so brilliantly.</i>

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.140
<i>It's so bright...</i>

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.510
<i>I can't see anymore.</i>

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:44.110
<i>In truth,</i>

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.910
<i>I'm afraid of the dark</i>

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:54.730
<i>and the future I can't see.</i>

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:56.900
Syunso-san!

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:01.170
Syunso-san, here you go.

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:08.850
Some of them got a little dirty, 
but I think this is all of them.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:11.100
One was caught in a tree,

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:13.220
another fell into a puddle,

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.610
a few of them were in the grass,

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:18.010
and a dog almost ate another one.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.860
It was pretty tough gathering them all up.

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:23.780
You...

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:31.410
Syunso-san, you made me a promise.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.810
Do you remember?

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:38.140
You were going to paint me.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.760
Please paint me.

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:51.240
But I...

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.680
My eyes...

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:03.940
I want to paint you.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.440
I've always wanted to draw you.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:28.160
These gentle and graceful curves...

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:33.260
This skin, soft and supple like fruit...

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:38.020
This long, flowing hair...

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:45.320
I have always admired you within the light.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:48.570
Syunso-san...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.720
This feeling may be a fleeting thing,

00:17:54.970 --> 00:18:00.090
but if I can make it last forever by 
reproducing it in a painting, then I...

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:08.900
I want to paint you.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.760
I want to paint.

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:18.990
I want to paint again.

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.380
I don't want to give up!

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.810
Syunso-san.

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:43.610
Wait!

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:55.970
We found the black cat.

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:57.480
The black cat!

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.370
Syunso-san, let's go!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.870
We've found the black cat.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.620
Where are we going?

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:07.630
Back home.

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:28.660
It came back...

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.830
Welcome home.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.030
Marvelous.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:51.700
How absolutely marvelous.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:57.070
You finally finished it.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.360
Ougai-san.

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:00.630
Syunso.

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.120
Yes?

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.690
That's a good expression.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.430
Congratulations, Syunso!

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:22.710
I am so happy. Truly wonderful 
indeed! That's my Syunso.

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:24.900
Come on, no, s-stop...

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:30.420
I am so, so glad.

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:32.850
Ougai-san...

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:37.370
Little Squirrel.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:38.160
Yes?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.850
What kind of magic did you use?

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:45.100
What? I-I didn't do anything so special.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:49.340
Honestly, you are something else.

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:53.280
Syunso, starting today, you will no 
longer call her Little Squirrel,

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:54.950
you will call her Madame Squirrel.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:58.110
You're the only one who 
calls her Little Squirrel.

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:03.230
I finally got to meet the black cat.

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:04.990
What a beautiful cat.

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.530
Its black fur is so soft.

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:13.340
With golden eyes that remind me of the moon—

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:30.800
Mei!

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:46.610
<b>Koizumi 
Yakumo</b>

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:46.610
<b>Mori Ougai 
Anthology</b>

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:51.000
Mei...

00:21:58.480 --> 00:21:59.630
Mei!

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:08.750
I remember...

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:12.290
everything.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Next Episode Preview

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Embraced by the Strawberry Moon

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:36.410
I was able to truly be myself 
because Ougai-san was there.

00:23:37.030 --> 00:23:39.900
I love you, Ougai-san.
